  "title": "Johnny Marzetti II",
  "description": "This hearty recipe makes enough casserole to feed a crowd. A flavorful blend of ground pork and beef is sauteed in butter with onion, celery and green pepper, then baked with tomatoes, kidney beans, pasta and cheese.",
